        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Inox EPIX01, Round Fingertip Edge Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis sliding door edge pull is mounted into the door's edge. For use on pocket doors, sliding doors, cabinet doors--any door where a flush with the door face small finger pull is desired. Can be used in the doors edge or on the door face. The Round Fingertip Edge Pull has a small lip for your finger to grab when used as a pocket door edge pull.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Inox EPIX01 Round Edge Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Diameter: 1-4/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Bore Hole Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Bore Hole Depth: 29/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Diameter (where you put your finger): 15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
